<title>CANADA: CWB wheat revs up 30 pct at C$3.8 bln in 1995/96.</title>
<headline>CWB wheat revs up 30 pct at C$3.8 bln in 1995/96.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board on Wednesday said its wheat pool account revenues rose 30 percent to C$3.8 billion in crop year 1995/96 (Aug/July) versus C$2.9 billion the prior year, the CWB's annual report showed.</p>
<p>			    1995/96			 1994/95</p>
<p> Revs		$3,812,102,708	   $2,919,771,669</p>
<p> Revs/Tonne		$265.606		   $199.429</p>
<p> Tonnes sold	   14,352,453		 14,640,658</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
